Template for facts that need a citation or valid source to confirm them.

==Usage==
To add this message, insert the following at the end of the statement in question:
<pre>{{Citation needed}}</pre>

===Parameters===
{{Docparam|name=&lt;unnamed 1>|req=yes|default=|desc=
Time stamp when the template was inserted. Use 5 tildes (<code><nowiki>~~~~~</nowiki></code>).}}